# Source and documentation keep the platform default.
* text=auto

# Deterministic generated artifacts must never be rewritten by git's end-of-line
# conversion. `shared/indieworlds/**` is generated with LF newlines by
# `npm run indieworlds:export`, and `npm run indieworlds:check` proves the
# checked-in bytes still match canonical registry/graph/lore data. Marking the
# files `-text` keeps them byte-exact on every platform, so a Windows checkout
# with `core.autocrlf=true` can no longer fail the gate on a pure CRLF rewrite.
#
# Attribute order matters: a later matching line overrides an earlier one, so this
# specific `-text` rule must stay after `* text=auto` to take effect.
shared/indieworlds/** -text
